    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95112" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοπ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοπιά</span>
			, <i>lookout-place, watchtower</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				713
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				289
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				309
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.2.11
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>observatory</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				2.5.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17.1.30
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυννοσκοπεῖον, ς.
				δαμοσία</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1000.10
			</span></i> (Cos, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>look-out, watch</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατρὸς σκοπαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					786
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				1311
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοπὰς ποιεῖσθαι ἀπὸ δένδρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					3.26
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
				29
			</span></i>.</div>
